# Supabase Edge Function Secrets
# Copy to supabase/.env (git-ignored) for local development.
# NEVER commit real secrets to version control.
#
# Set these in the Supabase Dashboard → Functions → Variables, or via CLI:
#   supabase secrets set SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=...
#
# These are used by Edge Functions (server-side only) and are NEVER
# shipped in the APK.

# Service role key for admin operations (account deletion, etc.)
# Get from Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → Service Role
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Google Gemini API key for AI-powered features
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
